 Installation Advisor (LLM proposal-only) ⊣ Installation Governor (closed-
 op-allowlist / site-verification / lift-plan-approval / installation-
 notification-lead-time / unresolved-concern hard-gates). Deliberately
 narrower in authority than the `cloud-itonami-isic-4211` (construction)
