 governor blocks, never overridable by human approval -- see
 `installation.governor` ns docstring), matching the same coordination-
 only, narrower-than-4211 shape `cloud-itonami-isic-4311` (Demolition) and
 `cloud-itonami-isic-4210` (Roads/railways construction) already
 established in this fleet. Every one of its four proposal ops
 (`:log-installation-record` / `:schedule-installation-operation` /
 `:flag-safety-concern` / `:order-supplies`) carries `:effect :propose`
 ONLY -- the governor HARD-holds any proposal that doesn't
 (`effect-not-propose-violations`), a structural invariant distinguishing
 this actor from siblings that DO commit real-world actuation effects.
 Per-jurisdiction (JPN/USA/DEU) rigging/lift-plan and installation-plan-
 notification legal-basis catalog (`installation.facts`) with real
