 workspace's cljs-first `.cljc` runtime-priority rule. `:flag-safety-
 concern` and `:schedule-installation-operation` ALWAYS escalate to a
 human, at every phase, unconditionally. See `docs/` -- README
 `Actuation` section -- for the full governor-check enumeration and the
 rationale for each hard/soft rule."}
